Landscape Concept
Using a simple, xeric palette of plants tolerant to the
salts used in winter street maintenance, the
landscape concept is designed for easy
maintenance and an overall aesthetic that will
enhance the Fox Farm Road corridor as a whole.
The pages herein decribe two general landsacpe treatements, urban and rural, as well as outline a suggested plant palette.
